            <section class="fullW flexR flexM" id="get-listed">
        <div class="boxW flexC flexM">

            <div class="section-desc fullW flexC flexM">

                                    <h2 class="section-title">Unlock Your Software’s Growth</h2>
                
                                    <p data-start="129" data-end="240">List your product on Tekpon and reach thousands of qualified buyers actively searching for software like yours.</p>
<p data-start="242" data-end="335">Boost your visibility, collect real user reviews, and convert interest into paying customers.</p>
<p><strong>Join the marketplace trusted by over 6,000 software companies to grow faster and sell smarter.</strong></p>
                
                                    <div class="section-cta fullW flexC flexM">
                        <a  href="https://tekpon.com/get-listed/"
                            class="btn bg blue"target="_blank">
                        Get Listed 
                        </a>
                    </div>
                
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
            <section class="fullW flexR flexM">
        <div class="boxW flexC section-desc"><h2>Generate SQLs &amp; MQLs, and Transform Them into Paying Customers</h2>
<div class="div-solid"  ></div>
<p><strong>We are here to help your business grow.</strong></p>
<p>At Tekpon, we have the competitive advantage of working with thousands of companies, allowing us to rank for the keywords your future customers are actively searching for.</p>
<span class="highlight hl-blue">Let us leverage our insights to assist you.</span>
<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
<div class="div-solid"  ></div>
<div class="faqList fullW flexC flexM g20"><br />
<div class="faqItem fullW flexC">

                <input type="checkbox" class="faqCheck" id="How+much+time+do+I+need+to+invest+in+Tekpon+to+generate+clients%3F" name="faqCheck2" checked>
                <label for="How+much+time+do+I+need+to+invest+in+Tekpon+to+generate+clients%3F" class="faqLabel fullW flexR g10">
                    <span class="faqIcon icon-arrow-down2"></span>
                    <h3 class="faqTitle">How much time do I need to invest in Tekpon to generate clients?</h3>
                </label>

                <div class="faqContent fullW">
                    <div class="fullW p25 g20 content xfR"></p>
<p data-start="248" data-end="389">We know you&#8217;re busy — that&#8217;s why we keep things simple.</p>
<p data-start="391" data-end="626">Setting up your listing takes about 60 minutes. After that, our team handles the rest: optimization, promotion, and support. We’ll check in with you throughout the year to make sure your profile performs and evolves with your business.</p>
<p data-start="628" data-end="724">Most of our customers spend less than 4 hours a year managing their Tekpon presence.</p>
<p></div>
                </div>

            </div><br />
<div class="faqItem fullW flexC">

                <input type="checkbox" class="faqCheck" id="How+many+customers+can+I+expect+from+Tekpon+each+month%3F" name="faqCheck2" checked>
                <label for="How+many+customers+can+I+expect+from+Tekpon+each+month%3F" class="faqLabel fullW flexR g10">
                    <span class="faqIcon icon-arrow-down2"></span>
                    <h3 class="faqTitle">How many customers can I expect from Tekpon each month?</h3>
                </label>

                <div class="faqContent fullW">
                    <div class="fullW p25 g20 content xfR"></p>
<p data-start="726" data-end="1003">Results vary based on your plan, your product’s appeal, and your market. Some partners generate a steady 5–10 new customers monthly, while others have seen surges of 1,000+ users over a few campaigns.</p>
<p data-start="1005" data-end="1147">Choosing a higher-tier plan gives you more exposure, data, and positioning tools — all designed to grow your lead pipeline faster.</p>
<p></div>
                </div>

            </div><br />
<div class="faqItem fullW flexC">

                <input type="checkbox" class="faqCheck" id="Is+Tekpon+still+offering+a+free+listing%3F" name="faqCheck2" checked>
                <label for="Is+Tekpon+still+offering+a+free+listing%3F" class="faqLabel fullW flexR g10">
                    <span class="faqIcon icon-arrow-down2"></span>
                    <h3 class="faqTitle">Is Tekpon still offering a free listing?</h3>
                </label>

                <div class="faqContent fullW">
                    <div class="fullW p25 g20 content xfR"></p>
<p data-start="1149" data-end="1269">No — all listings are now part of a one-time paid process.</p>
<p data-start="1271" data-end="1513">For just <strong data-start="1280" data-end="1288">$249</strong>, your software gets a fully optimized profile, SEO benefits, category placement, access to deal promotion, and visibility with high-intent buyers. This one-time fee ensures quality, relevance, and lead readiness.</p>
<p></div>
                </div>

            </div><br />
<div class="faqItem fullW flexC">

                <input type="checkbox" class="faqCheck" id="Does+Tekpon+conduct+vendor+audits%3F" name="faqCheck2" checked>
                <label for="Does+Tekpon+conduct+vendor+audits%3F" class="faqLabel fullW flexR g10">
                    <span class="faqIcon icon-arrow-down2"></span>
                    <h3 class="faqTitle">Does Tekpon conduct vendor audits?</h3>
                </label>

                <div class="faqContent fullW">
                    <div class="fullW p25 g20 content xfR"></p>
<p data-start="1515" data-end="1659">Yes! Our team regularly audits vendor pages to keep information up to date and accurate.</p>
<p data-start="1661" data-end="1861">If your product details or pricing have changed, just let us know — we’ll update your listing quickly. We also encourage vendors to proactively submit updates and keep their content fresh.</p>
<p></div>
                </div>

            </div></p>
<p><div class="faqItem fullW flexC">

                <input type="checkbox" class="faqCheck" id="What%E2%80%99s+the+difference+between+Premium+Seller%2C+Gold+Seller%2C+and+Platinum+Seller+plans%3F" name="faqCheck2" checked>
                <label for="What%E2%80%99s+the+difference+between+Premium+Seller%2C+Gold+Seller%2C+and+Platinum+Seller+plans%3F" class="faqLabel fullW flexR g10">
                    <span class="faqIcon icon-arrow-down2"></span>
                    <h3 class="faqTitle">What’s the difference between Premium Seller, Gold Seller, and Platinum Seller plans?</h3>
                </label>

                <div class="faqContent fullW">
                    <div class="fullW p25 g20 content xfR"></p>
<p data-start="1863" data-end="2011">Each plan unlocks more reach and results:</p>
<p data-start="2013" data-end="2164"><strong data-start="2013" data-end="2031">Premium Seller</strong> ($3,000/year): Get verified, display your brand badge, appear in category lists, and capture unlimited leads from high-intent users.</p>
<p data-start="2166" data-end="2346"><strong data-start="2166" data-end="2181">Gold Seller</strong> ($5,000/year): All Premium features + sponsor your primary category, get more visibility via comparison tools, an extra category slot, and a dedicated pricing page.</p>
<p data-start="2348" data-end="2580"><strong data-start="2348" data-end="2367">Platinum Seller</strong> ($12,000/year): All Gold features + sponsor up to 3 categories, gain maximum reach, access advanced SEO services, and receive an editorial review, priority comparison placements, and targeting tools for your ICP.</p>
<p data-start="2582" data-end="2676">If you need something custom, we can tailor a made-to-measure plan for your goals.</p>
<p></div>
                </div>

            </div></p>
<p></div>
<h3><strong>Discover the Power of Choice with Tekpon Pricing Plans</strong></h3>
<div class="div-fadeout"  ></div>
<p>At Tekpon, we understand that one size doesn&#8217;t fit all. That&#8217;s why our pricing plans are as unique as your business needs. So, whether you&#8217;re a burgeoning startup or an established player in the SaaS arena, our packages offer the flexibility and features to scale your success.</p>
<h3>Get Listed on Tekpon</h3>
<div class="div-fadeout"  ></div>
<p>The first step to growing with Tekpon? Listing your product — and unlocking visibility where it counts.</p>
<p>For a one-time fee of <strong data-start="334" data-end="342">$249</strong>, your software gets a fully optimized profile, designed for maximum exposure, SEO performance, and conversion.</p>
<p>Showcase your product, collect authentic reviews, and start reaching qualified buyers actively searching for solutions like yours.</p>
<p>Once you’re listed, you can upgrade anytime to one of our premium packages for even more exposure, leads, and growth support.</p>
<h3>Premium Seller Plan</h3>
<div class="div-fadeout"  ></div>
<p>Stand out. Build trust. Capture leads.</p>
<p>For a one-time <strong data-start="252" data-end="267">$3,000/year</strong>, the Premium Seller plan gives your software a verified profile and premium exposure — unlocking access to Tekpon’s global SaaS audience.</p>
<p data-start="407" data-end="423">What’s included:</p>
<p data-start="407" data-end="423"><div class="pretty-list chevron-list"></p>
<ul>
<li data-start="427" data-end="468"><strong data-start="427" data-end="447">Verified Profile</strong> with premium badge</li>
<li data-start="471" data-end="517"><strong data-start="471" data-end="489">Exclusive Deal</strong> slot to drive conversions</li>
<li data-start="520" data-end="557"><strong data-start="520" data-end="555">Unlimited clicks &amp; lead capture</strong></li>
<li data-start="560" data-end="611"><strong data-start="560" data-end="588">Dedicated Contact Button</strong> for direct inquiries</li>
<li data-start="614" data-end="650"><strong data-start="614" data-end="648">Feature on Best Software lists</strong></li>
<li data-start="653" data-end="697"><strong data-start="653" data-end="671">Demand Capture</strong> from high-intent buyers</li>
</ul>
<p></div></p>
<p data-start="699" data-end="826" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">This plan is your launchpad for consistent visibility, credibility, and lead generation — all without paying per click or lead.</p>
<h3>Gold Seller</h3>
<div class="div-fadeout"  ></div>
<p>Step up your software growth with deeper visibility and precision targeting.</p>
<p data-start="251" data-end="401">For <strong data-start="255" data-end="270">$5,000/year</strong>, the Gold Seller plan builds on everything in Premium — and adds strategic positioning to help you reach the right buyers, faster.</p>
<p data-start="403" data-end="419">What’s included:</p>
<p data-start="403" data-end="419"><div class="pretty-list chevron-list"></p>
<ul>
<li data-start="423" data-end="456"><strong data-start="423" data-end="454">All Premium Seller features</strong></li>
<li data-start="459" data-end="509"><strong data-start="459" data-end="489">Sponsor your main category</strong> for top placement</li>
<li data-start="512" data-end="542"><strong data-start="512" data-end="540">1 extra category listing</strong></li>
<li data-start="545" data-end="591"><strong data-start="545" data-end="571">Dedicated Pricing Page</strong> to showcase value</li>
<li data-start="594" data-end="642"><strong data-start="594" data-end="612">1 Compare Page</strong> to win side-by-side battles</li>
<li data-start="645" data-end="706"><strong data-start="645" data-end="660">Global Buzz</strong> AI-powered review summary from the entire web</li>
</ul>
<p></div></p>
<p data-start="708" data-end="823" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Reach decision-makers, boost conversions, and own your category with high-impact exposure and tailored positioning.</p>
<h3>Platinum Seller</h3>
<div class="div-fadeout"  ></div>
<p data-start="162" data-end="229">Maximize reach and authority across Tekpon’s platform — and beyond.</p>
<p data-start="231" data-end="383">For <strong data-start="235" data-end="251">$12,000/year</strong>, the Platinum Seller plan gives you top-tier visibility, full category sponsorship, and advanced SEO services tailored to your ICP.</p>
<p data-start="385" data-end="401">What’s included:</p>
<p data-start="385" data-end="401"><div class="pretty-list chevron-list"></p>
<ul>
<li data-start="405" data-end="435"><strong data-start="405" data-end="433">All Gold Seller features</strong></li>
<li data-start="438" data-end="492"><strong data-start="438" data-end="468">Sponsor up to 3 categories</strong> for dominant exposure</li>
<li data-start="495" data-end="532"><strong data-start="495" data-end="530">Up to 2 extra category listings</strong></li>
<li data-start="535" data-end="588"><strong data-start="535" data-end="554">Editor’s Review</strong> written by Tekpon’s expert team</li>
<li data-start="591" data-end="635"><strong data-start="591" data-end="610">3 Compare Pages</strong> to win buyer decisions</li>
<li data-start="638" data-end="692"><strong data-start="638" data-end="663">Advanced SEO services</strong> to improve discoverability</li>
<li data-start="695" data-end="747"><strong data-start="695" data-end="724">Dedicated Success Manager</strong> to guide your growth</li>
<li data-start="750" data-end="809"><strong data-start="750" data-end="772">Audience targeting</strong> by ICP, geo, and decision-maker role</li>
</ul>
<p></div></p>
<p data-start="811" data-end="899" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">This is your all-in growth engine, perfect for SaaS companies ready to lead the market.</p>
<h3>Need Something Tailored? Let’s Build It Together.</h3>
<div class="div-fadeout"  ></div>
<p data-start="235" data-end="305">Every SaaS product is unique, and your growth strategy should be too.</p>
<p data-start="307" data-end="519">If our standard plans don’t fit your exact goals, we’re happy to craft a custom plan just for you. Whether you need extra visibility, deeper integrations, or focused targeting, our team is here to make it happen.</p>
<p>💬 Let’s talk. <a href="https://tekpon.com/contact/">Get in touch</a> and unlock a go-to-market presence designed around your needs.</p>
<p><strong>📈 Ready to grow smarter?</strong></p>
<p>Choose your plan, or build your own.</p>
</div>
    </section>

    </main>

        
